      "id": "store2",
      "kind": "module",
      "label": "Session store",
      "sublabel": "polls every 2 s while a turn runs · keeps the last good report",
      "note": "Fixed 2026-09-04. loadReport() assigned whatever the fetch returned, and the helper returns null for ANY non-200 — and /report 404s until a plan event exists, which is the first seconds of every turn. So each poll in that window erased the plan the strip was waiting for. The poll was also gated on `report` already being set, so the strip could not appear until the turn ended, by which point the plan read complete and it archived itself on arrival.",
      "frame": "show",
      "tech": "Svelte 5 runes",
      "status": "done",
      "path": "panel/src/lib/stores/session.svelte.ts",
      "position": {
